  "segments": [
    {
      "seg": 0,
      "text": "Dude, I go to Seattle, I'm hyped. I'm ready to get off the plane. I watched Saving Private Ryan back to back three times. [clapping] I'm ready to shoot somebody. Let's [censored] storm the Capitol and",
      "recipe_id": "e26f03bbc485",
      "round": 2,
      "temp": 0.73,
      "speed": 0.89,
      "cue": "[delighted]",
      "vol": 0.0,
      "wpm": 162.1,
      "var_st": 4.1,
      "duration_ms": 13322,
      "score": 3.38,
      "target_wpm": 160.7
    },
    {
      "seg": 1,
      "text": "[censored] . And then I get to Seattle, everybody walks around. Every [censored] I met had, like, green hair. Every conversation I had in Seattle, they were all like, \"You know, America is built on a racist agenda.\"",
      "recipe_id": "2d78a9eb39aa",
      "round": 1,
      "temp": 0.77,
      "speed": 0.81,
      "cue": "[sarcastic]",
      "vol": 0.0,
      "wpm": 159.6,
      "var_st": 3.51,
      "duration_ms": 14289,
      "score": 3.37,
      "target_wpm": 156.4
    },
    {
      "seg": 2,
      "text": "Who gives a [censored] ? You're here on the winning side. If you don't like America, go check out Ukraine. Try to get an oatmeal latte in downtown Kiev, you ungrateful [censored]",
      "recipe_id": "be5af5b70272",
      "round": 2,
      "temp": 0.73,
      "speed": 0.85,
      "cue": "[angry]",
      "vol": 0.0,
      "wpm": 141.1,
      "var_st": 4.4,
      "duration_ms": 13609,
      "score": 3.92,
      "target_wpm": 138.3
    },
    {
      "seg": 3,
      "text": ". [clapping] If you don't like America, give me your passport.",
